        ],
        "text": "My family and I loved our stay!! The house was amazing!! The neighborhood is peaceful and quiet. We loved sitting on the balconies and enjoying the nice breeze from the ocean! The house was very clean and tidy. The location is great, very close to Grayton Beach State Park and restaurants/shops. The hosts, Emily & Mark, were super friendly and helpful! Would highly recommend and would stay there again anytime!! Thanks Emily and Mark!",
