        "id": "668eca2641437f705490b83a",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This is perhaps one of the best rentals in Santa Rosa!\nIt is conveniently located close to the beach, shopping and grocery stores, yet has a secluded feel off the beaten path. The owner was eager to please and made sure we had an exceptional stay. It feels like an “home” not just a rental. Everything is clean and top notch from mattresses to cookware. The elevator makes it easy to transport luggage to the 2nd and 3rd floor. Balconies on every floor!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "This one has it all!",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Lisa T.",
