            "response": "Lisa, it was a pleasure hosting you and the other ladies on your girls' trip. You are welcome back anytime!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The house is in a location that is hard to find parking. This is why I choose this location. The shuttle was close to walk to. Bikes are nice to go to the Grayton beach and Seaside or Santa Rosa Beach at 393. This 60 plus Yaya rode by bike to all 3 places. All 3 porches made the house even bigger. Perfect for a family or a girlfriend getaway. The elevator was perfect for the luggage. Mark was a quick responsive host as we had an issue with the elevator. It was quickly resolved and operator error. Kitchen had all we needed. Beds were comfortable. AC ran great. Fans on the 3rd floor deck was my favorite hangout. Furniture was comfortable throughout the house. We will be back.",
        "themes": [
